 "summary": "A surface-mount sealed-body metal alloy resistor in a 2512 package (6.4 × 3.2 mm, 0.75 mm thick). The HoYLR2512-2W-25mR-1% is 25 mΩ ±1%, rated 2 W with a maximum rated current of 8.94 A and a temperature coefficient of ±50 ppm/°C. It works from -55 to +170 °C at full power up to 70 °C ambient, the power falling linearly to zero at 170 °C. It is sulfur resistant, halogen-free, lead-free and RoHS compliant; listed uses include current sensing and voltage dividing, chargers, power adapters, power tools, lithium battery protection, digital and consumer products, smart home devices and appliances.",
